hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"42","(20) Pani se istinja karne ka bab: Abbas ibn al-Walid al-Bayruti ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Shu'ayb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Utbah ibn Abi Hakim al-Hamdani ne mujhe khabar di, Talhah ibn Nafi' se ke unhon ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub aur Jabir ibn Abdullah aur Anas ibn Malik al-Ansariyon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke jab ye ayat nazil hui: Fihe rijalun yuhibbuna an yatatahharu wallahu yuhibbul muttahhirin (Us me aise mard hain jo pak hona pasand karte hain aur Allah pak hone walon ko pasand karta hai), to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Ansar ki jama'at, beshak Allah ne taharat ke bare me tumhari khair ke sath sana ki hai, to ye tumhari taharat kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum namaz ke liye wuzu karte hain aur janabat se ghusl karte hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: To kya is ke sath is ke ilawa bhi kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwa is ke ke hum me se jab koi pakhana se nikalta hai to pani se istinja karna pasand karta hai, Aap ne farmaya: To wo yehi hai, pas tum is ko lazam pakro."
"43","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Maymunah se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni hajat ke liye tashrif le jate, to main aur hum me se ek larka idawah (pani ka bartan) ke sath Aap ke piche jate, phir jab Aap apni hajat puri kar lete to main Aap ko idawah pakra deta, pas Aap istinja karte."
